SUMMARY:Sand Volleyball May 18th
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Sports & Recreation (for Fun & Socializing)\nMonday 
 afternoon will finally start to feel like summer - come out for a game of 
 sand volleyball.\n\n6 pm until it gets dark (or people get hungry)\n\nGame
 s are casual and friendly\, with all experience levels welcome\; we have p
 eople just learning\, and others who played in college.\n\nWater and sunsc
 reen/cheap sunglasses recommended\; feel free to bring friends!\n\n(More t
 o come\, but if you can’t make this week\, we will try to hold (roughly)
  weekly games through the summer\, when weather permits 😊)
